README.md
LICENSE

third_party/
.runtime/
**/.git

# Runtime data never enters the image. Docker seeds memory from src/base_prompt.txt.
memory/
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
